<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Jan official reserves S$109.05 bln - MAS.</title>
<headline>Singapore Jan official reserves S$109.05 bln - MAS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official foreign reserves</p>
<p>(billions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Jan 97    Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
